---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: Excalifont
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 640
    padding: 18
    nodeSpacing: 44
    rankSpacing: 40
---
flowchart TD
    accTitle: fit — condition the selected model on an observation panel
    accDescr: A model the particle engine cannot fit, observations it cannot use, or non-finite draws fail the call. Otherwise Pathfinder initializes particle Gibbs on the exact nonlinear target, diagnostics are recorded, and the conditioned model commits as a new revision with its inference and check reports.

    request(["fit<br/>model_revision · panel_revision · settings?"])
    error["Fails · nothing saved<br/>the panel's measurement definitions differ<br/>the model is incomplete, or its laws cannot be fitted<br/>unsupported diffusion or interval measurements<br/>observations outside support, levels,<br/>standardization or prior reach<br/>initialization or draws are not finite"]
    init["Initialize<br/>Pathfinder on a Laplace approximation<br/>starting positions · preconditioner · reference paths"]
    sample["Particle Gibbs on the exact nonlinear target<br/>Euler–Maruyama transitions · true emission density"]
    diagnostics["Diagnostics<br/>R-hat · bulk and tail ESS · MCSE · acceptance<br/>PSIS-LOO when configured"]
    condition["Condition the model<br/>one joint law over parameters and latent paths"]
    checks["Checks on the conditioned model<br/>re-run: specification · compatibility<br/>reused: identification · data profile<br/>no predictive batch"]
    commit(["Commit conditioned model revision<br/>+ inference report + check reports + logs"])
    messages["Saved with messages<br/>warning: each failed check group<br/>diagnostics are recorded, not flagged"]

    request -. fails .-> error
    request --> init --> sample --> diagnostics --> condition --> checks --> commit
    messages -.- commit

    classDef action fill:#c026d3,stroke:#c026d3,color:#ffffff
    classDef decision fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,color:#0f172a
    classDef error fill:#fff1f2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef messages fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#b45309,color:#451a03
    classDef commit fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#064e3b
    classDef check fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#334155,color:#0f172a
    class request action
    class error error
    class messages messages
    class commit commit
    class checks check
